Notes on the plan of explanation

    - three explanantia alone appear to hold any promise of explaining both the safehold (6)
      and the coincidence in which it takes part (7)
        : join @ 26.thesis.notes.brec
        - hence my plan
            - dimiss none of the three
            - rather argue for each in concert with the others
    argumentation, ex hypothesi
        - qualifying propositions *ex hypothesi* by subscripting their indeces
          with the mnemonic of the hypothesis whose truth they assume

            H: as with a hypothesis in this form, for example,
              asserting that a certain explanans holds

            (76)⁠_\sf H\space⁠ and a proposition in this form
                : re `H` q.v. : ex hypothesi

        - arguing separately for the credibility of the hypothesis,
          which then attaches to its *ex hypothesi* propositions
